{"id":"e_chec","lemma":"échec","pos":"noun","rank":1886,"glosses":["failure","check"],"ipa":"/e.ʃɛk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0f/Fr-%C3%A9chec.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9chec.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"échecs"},"formAudio":{"échecs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-%C3%A9checs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La fête était un échec.","en":"The party was a failure.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"party, celebration"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Essaie de le tenir en échec.","en":"Try to keep it down.","words":[{"g":"to test, to try on","l":"essayer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Il a honte de son échec.","en":"He is ashamed of his failure.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"shame"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"Il est responsable de l'échec.","en":"He is to blame for the failure.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"responsible"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Cet échec est dû à votre erreur.","en":"This failure is due to your mistake.","words":[{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"error"}]}]}